      "writtenOn": "2026-06-08T14:59:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good question, I\u0027ll look into that. Some strings are optional so zero length is OK, but other strings are not.\n\nI assume in this case it\u0027s a zero length long form clientid?\n\nMaybe we should set up an xdr_string_noempty and xdr_opaque_no_empty\n\nOr the xdr for the structure could validate any required strings and opaques.\n\nWe should check that max size is also managed...",
      "parentUuid": "5762516e_c705398b",
      "revId": "ef4004f0e0024351de33090c01323ee071647b2a",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
